For the unbalanced reaction below, calculate $\mathcal{E}^{\circ}$ and indicate whether the reaction is spontaneous under standard conditions. Balance the reaction. Use $\mathcal{E}^{\circ}(\ce{Zn^{2+}}/\ce{Zn	}) =$-0.762V and $\mathcal{E}^{\circ}(\ce{Au^+}/\ce{Au}) =$1.83V
 \begin{center}\ce{	Zn_{(s)} + Au^+   <=>	 Au_{(s)}	+ Zn^{2+}	 	}     \end{center}
